
---
import Layout from "../layouts/layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="CV — Ariel Jiménez Segués"
  description="CV of Ariel Jiménez Segués, immersive audio and spatial sound designer working across audiovisual installations, interactive experiences and sound design."
>
  <main class="cv-page">
    <section class="cv-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">CURRICULUM VITAE / 2026</p>

      <h1>
        Ariel Jiménez<br />
        Segués.
      </h1>

      <p class="intro">
        IMMERSIVE AUDIO & SPATIAL SOUND DESIGN
      </p>

      <a
        class="cv-download"
        href="/cv/ariel-segues-cv.pdf"
        download
      >
        Download CV ↗
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section cv-profile">
      <div class="cv-label">
        <p class="section-label">01 / PROFILE</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-content">
        <p class="cv-lead">
          Immersive Audio and Sound Designer working across spatial
          sound, audiovisual installations and interactive media.
          With a background in music production, audio engineering
          and computer science.
        </p>

        <p>
          Experienced in creating sound for immersive audiovisual
          environments, exhibitions, animation and videogames.
          My work combines sound design, multichannel mixing and
          technical audio skills to create expressive sonic
          environments shaped around each project's needs.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <div class="cv-label">
        <p class="section-label">02 / EXPERIENCE</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-content">
        <article class="cv-entry">
          <div class="cv-date">2026 — PRESENT</div>

          <div class="cv-entry-body">
            <h2>Self-Employed Sound Designer</h2>

            <div class="cv-role">
              <h3>Framemov</h3>

              <p class="cv-company">
                Jan 2026 — Present
              </p>

              <ul>
                <li>
                  Sound design for immersive audiovisual
                  installations and cinematic experiences.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Sound design for immersive rooms, large-format
                  screens and videomapping projects.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Creation of atmospheres, effects and sonic
                  environments to support visual narratives.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Adapting sound to large-scale audiovisual
                  installations and spatial experiences.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="cv-role">
              <h3>5frame Studios</h3>

              <p class="cv-company">
                Feb 2026 — Present
              </p>

              <ul>
                <li>
                  Sound design for videogames and animated content.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Sound effects for bosses, creatures, animals,
                  spells, character actions and gameplay animations.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Designing and editing sounds to match animation,
                  timing and visual performance.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Creating detailed and expressive assets for
                  interactive and game environments.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cv-entry">
          <div class="cv-date">2024 — 2025</div>

          <div class="cv-entry-body">
            <h2>Mixing & Mastering Assistant</h2>

            <p class="cv-company">
              Jan Valls Estudio
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Audio editing, mixing and mastering.</li>
              <li>
                Optimisation for different distribution platforms
                and formats.
              </li>
              <li>
                Work with analogue hardware and professional
                audio software.
              </li>
              <li>Pro Tools, Logic Pro and Reaper.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <div class="cv-label">
        <p class="section-label">03 / AREAS OF PRACTICE</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-content">
        <div class="cv-skills-text">
          <p>Immersive Sound Design · Spatial Audio</p>
          <p>
            Multichannel Sound Design · Surround Mixing
          </p>
          <p>
            Audiovisual Installations · Sound for Exhibitions
          </p>
          <p>
            Sound Editing · Foley · Ambiences & Atmospheres
          </p>
          <p>
            Interactive Audio · Audio Implementation
          </p>
          <p>Music Composition · Audio Post-Production</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section cv-two-column">
      <div class="cv-block">
        <p class="section-label">04 / TOOLS & TECHNICAL</p>

        <div class="cv-subsection">
          <p class="cv-subsection-label">INTERACTIVE AUDIO</p>

          <div class="cv-list">
            <span>Wwise</span>
            <span>FMOD</span>
            <span>Unity</span>
            <span>Unreal Engine</span>
            <span>Godot</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cv-subsection">
          <p class="cv-subsection-label">AUDIO PRODUCTION</p>

          <div class="cv-list">
            <span>Pro Tools</span>
            <span>Reaper</span>
            <span>Logic Pro</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cv-subsection">
          <p class="cv-subsection-label">PROGRAMMING</p>

          <div class="cv-list">
            <span>C#</span>
            <span>C++</span>
            <span>Lua</span>
            <span>Python</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-block">
        <p class="section-label">LANGUAGES</p>

        <div class="language-list">
          <div>
            <span>Spanish</span>
            <span>Native</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span>Catalan</span>
            <span>Native</span>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span>English</span>
            <span>B2</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section">
      <div class="cv-label">
        <p class="section-label">05 / EDUCATION</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-content">
        <article class="cv-entry">
          <div class="cv-date">2020 — 2024</div>

          <div class="cv-entry-body">
            <h2>Sound Design & Music Production</h2>

            <p class="cv-company">
              ENTI · Universitat de Barcelona
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Sound design and music for videogames.</li>
              <li>Music production and composition.</li>
              <li>Recording and foley.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="cv-entry">
          <div class="cv-date">2015 — 2016</div>

          <div class="cv-entry-body">
            <h2>Computer Engineering</h2>

            <p class="cv-company">
              Universitat Politècnica de Catalunya
            </p>

            <ul>
              <li>Completed first year.</li>
              <li>C++, C#, Python, Java and Lua.</li>
              <li>Computer architecture.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cv-section cv-achievements">
      <div class="cv-label">
        <p class="section-label">06 / ACHIEVEMENT</p>
      </div>

      <div class="cv-content">
        <div class="achievement">
          <span>2024 · FEBRUARY</span>

          <p>
            High Honours in Mixing & Mastering with
            Toni Castaño.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
